  {
   "id": "g07",
   "no": 7,
   "week": 2,
   "emoji": "🚶",
   "title": "can / can't",
   "en": "can and can't",
   "reuse": null,
   "intro": [
    {
     "h": "能力同許可",
     "p": "<b>can</b> 後面用動詞原形，講識唔識，或者可唔可以。<br>否定係 <b>can't</b>（cannot）。問句將 can 搬去句頭。",
     "ex": [
      [
       "I can take the bus.",
       "我識搭巴士。"
      ],
      [
       "She can't drive.",
       "佢唔識揸車。"
      ],
      [
       "Can you help me?",
       "你可唔可以幫我？"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "⚠️ 香港人常犯",
     "p": "can 後面唔加 to，亦唔加 s。<br>✅ She can swim.　❌ She can to swim.　❌ She cans swim.",
     "ex": []
    }
   ],
   "exercises": [
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "She ___ wait for the bus.",
     "zh": "佢可以等巴士。",
     "o": [
      "can",
      "cans",
      "to can",
      "can to"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "can 後面直接接動詞原形。"
    },
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "He ___ drive a car.",
     "zh": "佢唔識揸車。",
     "o": [
      "can't",
      "isn't",
      "don't",
      "no"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "唔識做某件事用 can't。"
    },
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "___ you help me?",
     "zh": "你可唔可以幫我？",
     "o": [
      "Can",
      "Do",
      "Are",
      "Have"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "問能力或者許可，用 Can 開頭。"
    },
    {
     "t": "fill",
     "q": "I ___ walk to the park.",
     "zh": "我可以行去公園。",
     "a": [
      "can"
     ],
     "why": "can + 動詞原形。"
    },
    {
     "t": "fill",
     "q": "We can't ___ a taxi.",
     "zh": "我哋唔可以叫到的士？呢題係能力：叫的士用 take。",
     "a": [
      "take"
     ],
     "why": "can't 後面仍然係動詞原形 take。"
    },
    {
     "t": "tiles",
     "q": "砌一句",
     "zh": "我識行路。",
     "a": "I can walk.",
     "extra": [
      "to",
      "walking"
     ],
     "why": "can 後面用 walk，唔用 to walk。"
    }
   ],
   "ex": [
