  {
   "id": "g08",
   "no": 8,
   "week": 4,
   "emoji": "🧭",
   "title": "there is / there are + 介詞",
   "en": "there is and prepositions",
   "reuse": null,
   "intro": [
    {
     "h": "有冇呢樣嘢",
     "p": "單數同不可數用 <b>There is</b>；複數用 <b>There are</b>。<br>問句：<b>Is there</b> …? / <b>Are there</b> …?",
     "ex": [
      [
       "There is a bank near the park.",
       "公園附近有一間銀行。"
      ],
      [
       "There are two shops on this street.",
       "呢條街有兩間舖。"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "位置",
     "p": "常用 <b>in / on / near / opposite / between / behind</b>。<br>✅ The cinema is opposite the bank.",
     "ex": [
      [
       "The toilet is inside the station.",
       "廁所喺車站入面。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "exercises": [
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "___ a library near my home.",
     "zh": "我家附近有一間圖書館。",
     "o": [
      "There is",
      "There are",
      "It is",
      "They are"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "a library 係單數，用 There is。"
    },
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "___ two cafés on this road.",
     "zh": "呢條路有兩間咖啡店。",
     "o": [
      "There are",
      "There is",
      "It has",
      "Are"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "two 係複數，用 There are。"
    },
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "The bank is ___ the park.",
     "zh": "銀行喺公園附近。",
     "o": [
      "near",
      "there",
      "is",
      "are"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "near 表示附近。"
    },
    {
     "t": "fill",
     "q": "There ___ a hotel opposite the station.",
     "zh": "車站對面有一間酒店。",
     "a": [
      "is"
     ],
     "why": "a hotel 單數用 is。"
    },
    {
