  {
   "id": "g09",
   "no": 9,
   "week": 6,
   "emoji": "💰",
   "title": "how much / how many",
   "en": "how much and how many",
   "reuse": null,
   "intro": [
    {
     "h": "幾多",
     "p": "<b>How many</b> 問數得清嘅東西，後面通常複數。<br><b>How much</b> 問價錢，或者數唔清嘅東西。",
     "ex": [
      [
       "How many tickets do you need?",
       "你要幾多張票？"
      ],
      [
       "How much is this?",
       "呢個幾多錢？"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "價錢答法",
     "p": "答價錢可以用 <b>It's</b> + 數目。<br>✅ How much is the ticket? — It's twenty dollars.",
     "ex": [
      [
       "How much are the shoes?",
       "對鞋幾多錢？"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "exercises": [
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "___ tickets do you need?",
     "zh": "你要幾多張票？",
     "o": [
      "How many",
      "How much",
      "How long",
      "How old"
     ],
     "a": 0,
     "why": "tickets 數得清，用 How many。"
    },
    {
     "t": "mc",
     "q": "___ is this T-shirt?",
